\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces The executed ordered sieve. Criterion cells are newly excluded / remaining. Seconds are recorded pass wall times; 4 or 8 workers per stage are recorded in the ledger. Sphericalization/induction checks retained proof trees for $m\le 7$ and discovers proofs at $m=8$. Trees can use nested advanced filters; unfinished retained checks appear in the deferred row. Older residuals are retained. Later dimension-order, character, tensor-rotation and modular discovery targets $m\in \{3,8\}$. Timeouts remove nothing. This practical order is not claimed optimal.}}{51}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
